# Foxinal

SSH connection manager (in progress). Local-first dashboard (nested groups + SSH hosts) + **multi-tab** Local Terminal / SSH sessions via PTY.

## Auth / security

- **No server sync yet** — always local mode
- **First run / no master password** → open dashboard unlocked (no login screen)
- **Optional master password** — Settings → Account → Security; PBKDF2 verifier + **AES-GCM encrypted inventory** (`foxinal-inventory-vault`); plaintext `foxinal-inventory` when unset
- Unlock derives in-memory `CryptoKey`; saves re-encrypt; Lock clears key from memory
- **Lock prefs** (`foxinal-security-prefs`, Settings → Security): auto-lock after idle; lock when app is hidden — suspended while dialogs are open; no window.blur (false-triggers in Tauri)
- Session type: `AppSession` = `{ kind: "local" }` when unlocked

## Stack

| Layer | Tech |
|-------|------|
| Frontend | React 19, TypeScript, Vite 7, Tailwind v4, shadcn/ui, xterm, `@tabler/icons-react` |
| Backend | Rust (edition 2021), Tauri 2, `tauri-plugin-pty`, `ssh2` (SFTP) |
| Package manager | **pnpm** (see lockfile) |
| Bundle id | `com.foxinal` |

## UI components

- shadcn primitives in `src/components/ui/*` (`Button`, `Dialog`, `Input`, `Label`, `Tabs`, `Switch`, `Select`, `Slider`, `Separator`, `Textarea`, `Progress`, `Spinner`, `Checkbox`, `ScrollArea`)
- Dialog sizes: `default` | `wide` | `settings`; glass styles; `showCloseButton` defaults false
- Loading: `Spinner`, `Progress` (`indeterminate`), shared `ConnectionOverlay` (SSH/SFTP connect + error)
- **Toasts:** Sonner (`src/components/ui/sonner.tsx` + `<Toaster />` in `main.tsx`); helpers in `src/lib/toast.ts` (`success` / `error` / `info` / `warning`). Theme follows `data-theme` (no next-themes). Use for transient feedback; keep actionable overlays (Retry/Dismiss) on-page
- **Styling:** Tailwind v4 tokens + shadcn in `src/index.css` only — screens use utilities + shadcn (no BEM / no `features.css`). Shared: `Atmosphere`, `ThemeToggle`, `DialogIcon`, `ConnectionOverlay`
- **xterm FitAddon:** never pad the measure host; put padding on `.xterm` inside `.fox-xterm-host` (`src/styles/xterm-host.css` imported by TerminalView) or the last row clips
- Inventory dialogs + `SettingsDialog` use shadcn Dialog (`open` / `onOpenChange`)
- Settings tabs: only active panel mounted (no `forceMount`); body height animates via ResizeObserver
- Shared UI: `src/components/{BrandMark,ThemeToggle,Dashboard,TerminalView,ConnectionOverlay,Atmosphere,DialogIcon}.tsx`
- Hooks: `src/hooks/{useTheme,useLockGuards}.ts`
- `cn` from `@/lib/utils`; use `@/` imports across features

## Layout

```
src/
  App.tsx                 # unlock gate
  components/             # BrandMark, Atmosphere, ThemeToggle, Dashboard, TerminalView, ConnectionOverlay, DialogIcon, ui/*
  hooks/                  # useTheme, useLockGuards
  lib/                    # utils, sessions, version, toast
  styles/xterm-host.css   # FitAddon-safe xterm host (imported by TerminalView)
  inventory/ settings/ sftp/ security/
```

- `src/components/Dashboard.tsx` — navbar + inventory + session tab strip (PTYs stay mounted when switching)
- `src/lib/sessions.ts` — tab model; `src/lib/version.ts` — app name/version from `package.json`
- `src/settings/` — SettingsDialog + terminalPrefs
- `src/security/` — masterPassword, vault, session, prefs (lock guards hook lives in `hooks/`)
- `src/sftp/` — dual-pane SFTP; kept mounted when switching nav
- `src-tauri/src/sftp.rs` — transfer connections separate from browse; cancel/progress per transferId

## Inventory / SSH

- Storage: `localStorage` `foxinal-inventory` (host secrets plaintext for now)
- Host fields: label, address, port (22), username, password **or** private key
- **Sibling names unique** under each parent (groups + hosts share the namespace)
- **Duplicate host** (copy icon) opens prefilled create dialog (`name copy`, same credentials)
- Dashboard: **search** current folder **and nested** groups/hosts (shows relative path), **list/grid** + **A–Z / Z–A** (`foxinal-inventory-layout`, `foxinal-inventory-sort`)
- **Import / Export** JSON (`foxinal-inventory` v1): at root = whole inventory; inside a group = that group’s subtree / import into that group
- **Inventory** — click (or Enter) a group to open / a host to connect; grip-drag to move
- **Drag-and-drop**: pointer-based (not HTML5 — unreliable in Tauri WebKit); grip `onPointerDown` → window `pointermove`/`pointerup` + `elementsFromPoint` on `[data-fox-drop]`; drop opens destination; blocked for self/descendant / name clash / already there
- **SFTP** — dual panes; ⌘/Ctrl multi-select + grip-drag copy; concurrent transfers with separate progress/cancel; browse works while transferring; optimistic delete & soft refresh
- Password auth auto-types when SSH password prompt appears; temp keys cleaned via `cleanup_ssh_temp`
- SSH launch (`prepare_ssh_launch`): `ServerAliveInterval=30`, `ServerAliveCountMax=3`, `TCPKeepAlive=yes` so idle tabs survive app switch / NAT timeouts
- SSH disconnect after ready → Disconnected overlay with **Reconnect** (same tab / host); first-connect failures keep **Retry**
- Local navbar item opens another OS shell tab

## UI theme

Clean liquid-glass system via Tailwind v4 tokens in `src/index.css` (Space Grotesk **bundled locally** via `@fontsource/space-grotesk` — no Google Fonts / offline-safe). UI is utilities + shadcn (no separate feature BEM stylesheet). Unlock uses brand header + card; dashboard uses segmented nav + session badge. Terminal font/size/theme via Settings (`foxinal-terminal-prefs`; system mono stacks only).

## Brand / icons

- Mark: white fox (pointed ears, cheek tufts, almond eyes) + terminal `>` / cursor cutouts on fox-orange squircle (`#ea580c` → `#c2410c`)
- Masters: `app-icon.png` (1024, transparent corners) + matching `app-icon.svg` (traced evenodd fox path — not the old soft geometric fox)
- Regenerate: `pnpm tauri icon app-icon.png` — do not feed SVG straight to `tauri icon` (can warp the path)
- Bundle icons: `src-tauri/icons/` (icns/ico/png)
- Favicon: `public/foxinal.svg`; UI mark: `public/foxinal-icon.png` via `BrandMark`

## Commands

```bash
pnpm tauri dev      # required for PTY/SSH; Vite :1420
pnpm tauri build
pnpm dev            # frontend only — terminal/SSH fail without Tauri
```

## Release / CI

- Workflow: `.github/workflows/release.yml` — `prepare` creates/reuses one draft release; matrix builds (macOS arm64 + x64, Linux x64) upload into that `releaseId` (avoids parallel-upload races that drop assets)
- Trigger: push tag `v*` or Actions → **release** → Run workflow
- Version resolved once in `prepare` (`scripts/set-version.mjs`); matrix jobs sync the same version
- Manual/local: `pnpm version:set 0.2.0` / `pnpm version:patch`
- Prefer org/repo Workflow permissions → **Read and write**; if greyed out, secret `RELEASE_TOKEN` (PAT with contents write)
- Backend: `ssh2` with `vendored-openssl` (macOS x86_64 cross-compile from arm64 runners)
- No Apple signing/notarization yet (users: `xattr -cr /Applications/foxinal.app`)

## Conventions

- Prefer Tauri 2 docs; update `capabilities/default.json` when adding plugins
- UI: add shadcn pieces with `pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add <name>`; keep Tabler icons (`iconLibrary: tabler` in `components.json`)
- Prefer `@/` imports for `components`, `hooks`, `lib`, and feature modules
- A11y: label icon-only controls; use `inert` on parked session/SFTP panes; inventory opens on click/Enter; SFTP folders open on Enter; toggles use `aria-pressed`
- Never commit `src-tauri/target/`, `node_modules/`, `dist/`, `.env` / `.env.*` (keep `.env.example`), `.pnpm-store/`
- Next: recovery key, OS keychain, host-key UX, jump hosts, server sync
